{"variant":"with","turns":[{"request":"Project \"Atlas\": an AI agentic platform for enterprises (users and apps, API gateway, orchestrator, planner and worker agents, tool gateway, model router, memory, retrieval, guardrails, human approval, observability, data stores). Draw its system architecture.","reply":"I drew Atlas left to right: users → API gateway → guardrails → orchestrator (the focal point) → planner and worker agents → model router and tool gateway, with human approval above, memory, retrieval and data stores below, and observability across the bottom.\n\nI assumed guardrails check traffic both ways and human approval is triggered by the orchestrator for risky actions; if tool calls should also pass through guardrails, I can add that link.","ok":true,"subtype":"success","durationMs":27478,"toolTurns":2,"outputTokens":3881},{"request":"Now add Atlas's technical documentation to the right of the architecture, one frame per document: agent execution flow, data model, API contract, security and guardrails, deployment, and non-functional requirements.","reply":"I added six frames in a 3 × 2 grid to the right of the architecture: execution flow, data model, API contract, security and guardrails, deployment, and non-functional requirements.\n\nThe endpoints, entities, infrastructure choices and targets (such as 99.9% availability, 1,000 concurrent runs, and SOC 2 and GDPR alignment) are my proposed assumptions, so please check them against your real requirements.","ok":true,"subtype":"success","durationMs":70003,"toolTurns":2,"outputTokens":11335},{"request":"Now add a client presentation for Atlas below everything: 6 slides, one frame per slide, that a non-technical buyer can follow.","reply":"I added the six-slide presentation below the existing work: the title, the problem, how it works, an invoice example, how the buyer stays in control, and a pilot plan with a next step.\n\nThe pilot timeline, the 60-minute session and the invoice scenario are placeholders I assumed, so adjust them to your actual offer before showing a client.","ok":true,"subtype":"success","durationMs":31077,"toolTurns":2,"outputTokens":4760}],"ops":[{"turn":1,"op":"add","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"title","x":0,"y":-80,"text":"Atlas: one orchestrator runs every agent, with guarded access to models and tools","fontSize":32},{"type":"text","id":"sub","x":0,"y":-32,"text":"Blue = entry   Purple = agents   Yellow = safety and control   Green = gateways and context   Grey = data and external","fontSize":16,"strokeColor":"#495057"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"users","x":0,"y":360,"width":160,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Users & apps","fontSize":20}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"api","x":240,"y":360,"width":160,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"API gateway\nauth, limits","fontSize":18}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"guard","x":480,"y":360,"width":160,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Guardrails\nin + out checks","fontSize":18}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"orch","x":720,"y":330,"width":240,"height":140,"backgroundColor":"#9775fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":4,"label":{"text":"Orchestrator\nstate, routing,\nretries","fontSize":24}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"human","x":740,"y":80,"width":200,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Human approval\nreview queue","fontSize":18}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"planner","x":1120,"y":220,"width":180,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Planner agent\nbreaks down goals","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"worker3","x":1136,"y":516,"width":180,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","fillStyle":"solid"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"worker2","x":1128,"y":508,"width":180,"height":80,"backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","fillStyle":"solid"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"worker","x":1120,"y":500,"width":180,"height":80,"backgro